  "inline_comments": [],
  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Closing: the fp32 MoE LoRA path now passes on gfx950 with Triton 3.6, 3.7 and 3.8 on current `main` (108/108), so the unpipelined fallback is no longer needed.",
